& [P5RuntimeAdapterAndTransportPosture] is the adapter and transport posture for current P5 runtime implementation
  + [external_langgraph_adapter_status] is not_implemented
  + [graph_runtime_execution_against_live_state_authorized] is false
  + [checkpoint_persistence_adapter_status] is not_implemented
  + [transport_implementation_status] is not_implemented
  + [socket_or_network_listener_authorized] is false
  + [mailbox_IO_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_status] is not_implemented

  = must: require future accepted authority before checkpoint persistence leaves disposable generated roots
  = must: require future accepted authority before any runtime output is projected to live surfaces, transports, sockets, mailboxes, UI, process runners, GPU tools, model runtimes, or job queues
  = must: reject adapter behavior that writes source authority, mutates expected ledgers, mutates proof ledgers outside accepted proof-review slices, assigns work, dispatches work, controls operations, or controls live machine state

